                  name = "Lever Leg Extension"
                  description = "<p><strong>Execution Notes:</strong></p><p>Set the seat back as far as it will go while still feeling comfortable. Grab the handles as hard as you can to pull your butt down into the seat. Use a 2-3 second negative. Feel your quads pulling apart on the negative.</p><p><strong>Protocol Details:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Rest:</strong> 1-2 min</li><li><strong>Warm-up Sets:</strong> 1-2</li></ul><p><strong>Substitution Options:</strong></p><ul><li>Reverse Nordic</li><li>Sissy Squat</li></ul>"
